    "detailed_description": "Dokkalfheim Magical University is a turn based battle game in development using RPG Maker MV. The player builds teams of three witches out of a small selection of students and professors at the university as they protect the vulnerable world from the undead of fallen civilizations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach witch has two basic spells and an ultimate spell which needs to be charged. The witches are categorized as:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRed Witches, whose spells target enemies<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlue Witches, whose spells target allies<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPurple Witches, who have a mix of &quot;red&quot; and &quot;blue&quot; spells.",
    "about_the_game": "Dokkalfheim Magical University is a turn based battle game in development using RPG Maker MV. The player builds teams of three witches out of a small selection of students and professors at the university as they protect the vulnerable world from the undead of fallen civilizations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach witch has two basic spells and an ultimate spell which needs to be charged. The witches are categorized as:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRed Witches, whose spells target enemies<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlue Witches, whose spells target allies<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPurple Witches, who have a mix of &quot;red&quot; and &quot;blue&quot; spells.",
